{"id":"wb-7-1463","name":"酒泉鼓楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"酒泉鼓楼","text":"酒泉鼓楼，位于中华人民共和国甘肃省酒泉市肃州区，始建于十六国前凉时期，为城墙东门楼，明代时由于城墙外扩而处于城中心位置，清朝时因兵变焚毁，光绪年间重修。酒泉鼓楼共分为台基和木楼两部分，其中台基夯土部分为前凉时期所建，其外砌有清代所建的砖墙，四面开有可供通行的券门。木楼位于台基之上，共有三层，东侧和西侧挂有牌匾。2013年，酒泉鼓楼被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%85%92%E6%B3%89%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":85690649,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85690649","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f16fb63c086a8ec3ddfdc06d.jpg","title":"Jiuquan_Gulou_2014.01.01_16-13-37.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiuquan_Gulou_2014.01.01_16-13-37.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Jiuquan_Gulou_2014.01.01_16-13-37.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"酒泉鼓楼西面","width":320,"height":213}}